 class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208900/extras/accadee9780cc3eadcf7596ad2ff17ac.poster.avif?t=1747005869\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208900/extras/accadee9780cc3eadcf7596ad2ff17ac.webm?t=1747005869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208900/extras/accadee9780cc3eadcf7596ad2ff17ac.mp4?t=1747005869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bows are for crazy people.</strong> You do the highest amount of damage while having the hardest time landing shots.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A high skill is required to use bows effectively.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208900/extras/6aaed8358ae71db0880b674d4928122f.webp?t=1747005869\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208900/extras/4926546e5ab9503d2bc60c491c804164.poster.avif?t=1747005869\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208900/extras/4926546e5ab9503d2bc60c491c804164.webm?t=1747005869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2208900/extras/4926546e5ab9503d2bc60c491c804164.mp4?t=1747005869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete <strong>8 hand crafted missions </strong>and challenge optional bosses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>",
